# Native (Capacitor) build only — `npm run build:native` = `vite build
# --mode native`. Vite loads .env.[mode], so .env.production is NOT read
# here: the two Supabase values are mirrored from it (src/env.native.test.js
# keeps them equal). The origin is the VERCEL deployment, never
# onrender.com — the rewrite proxy stays in the path (see lib/api.js and
# docs/adr/0008). vite.config.js refuses any non-native build that
# carries VITE_API_ORIGIN.
